p('Suggested 3-sentence correction - student review required: A passing signature check establishes the expected signer for this digest, but does not by itself prove denial behavior or trustworthy build provenance. The same gate now has a genuine wrong-identity rejection, while the original unsigned-image test separately proves missing-signature rejection. This strengthens the observed signature-policy evidence without claiming a full lockfile, a private-index implementation or a SLSA level.')
