p('The final prompt used for this exercise is the real Task 4 user request reproduced below; the response is the full actual answer in Section 9. It is broad, but explicitly requires isolated hash enforcement, a digest-pinned identity policy and no unsupported SLSA claim. No shorter imagined prompt or invented refinement is substituted. The output defense artifact is support/task4-verification-gate.sh; no automated claim that the vulnerability was patched everywhere is made.')
